| No tooltip registration or public tooltip-internal access | 3, 5, 6, 10 | Render/provider units; public API audit; installed-runtime inspection |
| No custom marker, map overlay renderer, or reveal helper | 5, 10 | Indicator units; source/symbol audit; installed-runtime observation |
| No completion from displayed marker or cached visual sample | 5, 7, 10 | Indicator/input units; installed-runtime click sampling |
| No migration of DwarfUI, DwarfDirect, or another consumer | 1, 9, 10 | File-map/diff audit; final independent review |

